{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1733","id":4144532999,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p873CI4H","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1733","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1733.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1733.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1733","number":1733,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[codex] produce P3 Differential Equations semantics","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #1723\n\nParent: #1721\nPredecessor: #1722 / PR #1732\n\n## Why\n\nThe active Paper 3 semantic authority contained Integration Techniques and the P3-00 ProcedureInstance composition contract, but no reviewed Differential Equations shard. As a result, verified Differential Equations questions and parts had no cumulative, product-consumable QuestionType, ProcedureModel, ProcedureInstance, or authenticated readback representation.\n\n## What changed\n\n- Bound production to exact merged predecessor `7f76733e8cfae00bbc9f0620e2f768683aa2b2b6` (tree `5ca1896ded63fc4a1a8bf5967891b50f5766dd58`).\n- Reviewed all 65 verified Differential Equations questions and all 112 score-owning QuestionParts with terminal exact QP/MS evidence dispositions.\n- Added three evidence-bound Differential Equations QuestionTypes and one stable separable first-order Differential Equations ProcedureModel. Ordinary separation, rearrangement, integration, initial-condition application, and result checking remain internal steps.\n- Added 64 approved core ProcedureInstances and isolated 10 non-trivial Integration Techniques supporting applications as candidates; two additional foreign-Family candidates remain explicitly unmodeled rather than being promoted.\n- Preserved every #1719/P3-00 semantic record, graph node/edge, and ProcedureInstance, then rebuilt the cumulative registry, shared procedure library, KG projection, active manifest, and raw-byte-authenticated product readback.\n- Made the P3-00 deterministic validator successor-aware by authenticating its exact predecessor manifest hash when a cumulative successor is active.\n\n## Metrics\n\n- discoverable source rows: 72\n- verified in-scope questions: 65\n- excluded unverified legacy `qrow_WM_*` rows: 7\n- reviewed questions: 65\n- reviewed score-owning QuestionParts: 112\n- approved / candidate / rejected part dispositions: 99 / 6 / 7\n- primary / secondary classifications: 99 / 0\n- core / supporting ProcedureInstances: 64 / 10\n- alternative branches: 0\n- Differential Equations abstentions: 0\n- cumulative P3 records: 361\n- cumulative QuestionTypes / ProcedureModels: 8 / 6\n- procedure reuse ratio: 39.0\n- approved product readback: 100%\n\n## Integrity gates\n\nAll required gates pass, including zero cross-Family primary ownership conflicts, zero approved ProcedureInstances without exact part evidence, zero incidental operations promoted to ProcedureModels, zero candidates exposed as approved, zero dangling or unsupported inferred edges, and zero structural authority writes.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1719_integration_techniques_semantic_kg.test.py` — 13 tests passed\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1722_p3_semantic_composition.test.py` — 10 tests passed\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1723_differential_equations_semantic_kg.test.py` — 9 tests passed\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/issue_1719_integration_techniques_semantic_kg.py --check` — PASS\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/issue_1722_p3_semantic_composition.py --check` — PASS\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/issue_1723_differential_equations_semantic_kg.py --check` — PASS\n- `git diff --check` — PASS\n- all cumulative P3 JSON artifacts parse with `jq empty`\n\nNo provider calls, new screenshots, structural re-extraction, RAG work, or production/remote data writes were performed.\n","created_at":"2026-07-27T17:11:30Z","updated_at":"2026-07-27T17:48:30Z","closed_at":"2026-07-27T17:43:26Z","merged_at":"2026-07-27T17:43:26Z","merge_commit_sha":"d6625dba24f8160ef497252a12cc14156f914d15","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1733/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1733/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1733/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/a2ac19835bffd361bc57c3d324a097fb86287356","head":{"label":"Samsen879:task/1723-p3-differential-equations-semantic-production","ref":"task/1723-p3-differential-equations-semantic-production","sha":"a2ac19835bffd361bc57c3d324a097fb86287356","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":